      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-07-17",
        "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on S. 1582.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-07-17",
        "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 4016, H.R. 3633, H.R. 1919 and S. 1582. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 4016 and H.R. 3633 under a structured rule, and H.R. 1919 and S. 1582 under a closed rule, with one hour of general debate on each bill. The resolution provides for a motion to recommit on H.R. 4016, H.R. 3633, and H.R. 1919, and a motion to commit on S. 1582.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
